<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Trang không tồn tại - Make Trip To Easy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      background: white;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-in-out;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 80px;
      color: #0284c7;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      color: #475569;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .url-box {
      background: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .suggestions ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .suggestions li {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .suggestions a {
      color: #0284c7;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .suggestions a:hover {
      color: #0369a1;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .btn-group {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: #0284c7;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.25s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #0369a1;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #64748b;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #4b5563;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="icon">
      <i class="fas fa-map-signs"></i>
    </div>

    <h1>Oops! Trang bạn tìm không tồn tại</h1>
    <p>Chúng tôi không thể tìm thấy đường dẫn bạn vừa truy cập.</p>

    <div class="url-box">
      <i class="fas fa-link"></i> <%= url %>
    </div>

    <p>Không biết bạn muốn đến trang này?</p>

    <div class="suggestions">
      <ul>
        <% suggestions.forEach(link => { %>
          <li><a href="<%= link %>"><%= link %></a></li>
        <% }) %>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/" class="btn"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Về trang chủ</a>
      <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn btn-secondary">
        <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Quay lại
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
